      {
        "id": "kl-re-choices-card-06",
        "scriptName": "昆仑-互动剧情选项美化卡片(显示, 0~1层)",
        "disabled": false,
        "runOnEdit": true,
        "findRegex": "/<choices>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/choices>/g",
        "trimStrings": [],
        "replaceString": "```\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>互动剧情面板 - 极速对齐版</title>\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --surface-color: rgba(28, 28, 34, 0.98);\n            --surface-hover: rgba(55, 55, 62, 0.7);\n            --outline: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n            --text-primary: #e4e4e7;\n            --text-secondary: #9ca3af;\n            --brand-color: #8b5cf6;\n            --brand-alpha: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);\n            --round-large: 16px;\n            --round-small: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .decision-board, .decision-board * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 16px;\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n            color: var(--text-primary);\n            background: transparent;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .decision-board {\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 760px; \n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background: var(--surface-color);\n            border: 1px solid var(--outline);\n            border-radius: var(--round-large);\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); \n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .board-topbar {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 16px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n            cursor: pointer;\n            user-select: none;\n            transition: background 0.15s;\n        }\n\n        .board-topbar:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n        }\n\n        .topbar-title {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n        }\n\n        .icon-indicator {\n            color: var(--brand-color);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            transition: transform 0.2s ease;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n\n        /* 收纳状态下图标微调提示 */\n        .decision-board.is-collapsed .icon-indicator {\n            transform: rotate(-90deg);\n            opacity: 0.7;\n        }\n\n        .behavior-toggles {\n            display: flex;\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 2px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .toggle-item {\n            background: transparent;\n            border: none;\n            color: var(--text-secondary);\n            padding: 4px 12px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            border-radius: 18px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n        }\n\n        .toggle-item.is-selected {\n            background: var(--brand-color);\n            color: #fff;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* 强制隐藏优先级，防止外部CSS覆盖 */\n        .foldable-zone.hidden-zone {\n            display: none !important;\n        }\n\n        .choice-track {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding: 16px 20px 20px 20px;\n            gap: 10px;\n            margin: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .choice-block {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: row;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: 12px;\n            padding: 14px 16px;\n            border-radius: var(--round-small);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .choice-block:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n            border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);\n        }\n        \n        .choice-block::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            top: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            width: 3px;\n            background: var(--brand-color);\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.15s;\n        }\n\n        .choice-block:hover::before {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        .pill-tag {\n            background: var(--brand-alpha);\n            color: #a78bfa;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            padding: 4px 8px;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);\n            margin-top: 2px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .detail-text {\n            flex: 1;\n            min-width: 0;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: var(--text-primary);\n            word-break: break-word;\n            overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n        }\n\n        /* 手机窄屏自适应：当屏幕小于 520px 时，标签自动放到文字上方，彻底避免长标签把正文挤成竖列 */\n        @media (max-width: 520px) {\n            .choice-block {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                gap: 8px;\n            }\n            .pill-tag {\n                white-space: normal;\n                align-self: flex-start;\n                margin-top: 0;\n            }\n            .detail-text {\n                width: 100%;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- 默认加上 is-collapsed -->\n<div class=\"decision-board is-collapsed\" id=\"boardRoot\">\n    <div class=\"board-topbar\" id=\"accordionTrigger\">\n        <div class=\"topbar-title\">\n            <span class=\"icon-indicator\">❖</span>\n            抉择时刻\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"behavior-toggles\" id=\"strategySelectors\">\n            <button class=\"toggle-item\" data-strategy=\"concat\">追加文本</button>\n            <button class=\"toggle-item\" data-strategy=\"direct\">直接触发</button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 默认加上 hidden-zone 和 style=\"display: none;\" 双重保险 -->\n    <div class=\"foldable-zone hidden-zone\" id=\"foldableArea\" style=\"display: none;\">\n        <ul class=\"choice-track\" id=\"interactiveTrack\"></ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<template id=\"sourcePayload\">$1</template>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n    'use strict';\n    function escHtml(v){return String(v??'').replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').replace(/\"/g,'&quot;').replace(/'/g,'&#39;');}\n\n    const APP_CONFIG = {\n        memoryKey: 'story_panel_strategy',\n        defaultStrategy: 'concat'\n    };\n\n    class StoryController {\n        constructor() {\n            this.nodes = {\n                board: document.getElementById('boardRoot'),\n                payload: document.getElementById('sourcePayload'),\n                track: document.getElementById('interactiveTrack'),\n                toggles: document.querySelectorAll('.toggle-item'),\n                accordion: document.getElementById('accordionTrigger'),\n                foldable: document.getElementById('foldableArea'),\n                selectorGroup: document.getElementById('strategySelectors')\n            };\n            \n            this.currentStrategy = localStorage.getItem(APP_CONFIG.memoryKey) || APP_CONFIG.defaultStrategy;\n            this.mount();\n        }\n\n        mount() {\n            // 初始化时强制确保处于收纳状态\n            if (this.nodes.foldable) {\n                this.nodes.foldable.classList.add('hidden-zone');\n                this.nodes.foldable.style.display = 'none';\n            }\n            this.buildUI();\n            this.attachListeners();\n            this.syncToggleVisuals();\n        }\n\n        extractData() {\n            const rawContent = this.nodes.payload ? ((this.nodes.payload.content ? this.nodes.payload.content.textContent : this.nodes.payload.textContent) || \"\") : \"\";\n            const lines = rawContent.split('\\n').map(str => str.trim()).filter(Boolean);\n            \n            return lines.map(line => {\n                // 优先用正则精准匹配：【标签】：内容 或 1. [标签]: 内容（不再受 15 个字符长度限制）\n                const bracketMatch = line.match(/^(?:\\d+[\\.\\、\\s]*)?[【\\[]([^】\\]]+)[】\\]][\\s]*[：:]([\\s\\S]*)$/);\n                if (bracketMatch) {\n                    return {\n                        tag: bracketMatch[1].trim(),\n                        text: bracketMatch[2].trim()\n                    };\n                }\n\n                // 兜底匹配普通冒号分隔（将长度限制放宽到 30 字符以内）\n                const idxCN = line.indexOf('：');\n                const idxEN = line.indexOf(':');\n                let separatorIndex = -1;\n                if (idxCN !== -1 && idxEN !== -1) {\n                    separatorIndex = Math.min(idxCN, idxEN);\n                } else {\n                    separatorIndex = Math.max(idxCN, idxEN);\n                }\n\n                if (separatorIndex > 0 && separatorIndex <= 30) {\n                    let prefix = line.substring(0, separatorIndex).trim();\n                    prefix = prefix.replace(/^\\d+[\\.\\、\\s]*/, '').replace(/^[【\\[\\s]+|[】\\]\\s]+$/g, '').trim();\n                    return { tag: prefix, text: line.substring(separatorIndex + 1).trim() };\n                }\n\n                // 如果完全没有标签，去掉开头的序号直接显示\n                return { tag: null, text: line.replace(/^\\d+[\\.\\、\\s]*/, '').trim() };\n            });\n        }\n\n        buildUI() {\n            const parsedItems = this.extractData();\n            \n            const htmlString = parsedItems.map((item) => {\n                const tagMarkup = item.tag ? `<div class=\"pill-tag\">${escHtml(item.tag)}</div>` : '';\n                return `\n                    <li class=\"choice-block\" data-val=\"${escHtml(encodeURIComponent(item.text))}\">\n                        ${tagMarkup}\n                        <div class=\"detail-text\">${escHtml(item.text)}</div>\n                    </li>\n                `;\n            }).join('');\n\n            if (this.nodes.track) {\n                this.nodes.track.innerHTML = htmlString;\n            }\n        }\n\n        attachListeners() {\n            if (this.nodes.accordion && this.nodes.foldable) {\n                this.nodes.accordion.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                    const isHidden = this.nodes.foldable.classList.toggle('hidden-zone');\n                    this.nodes.foldable.style.display = isHidden ? 'none' : 'block';\n                    if (this.nodes.board) {\n                        this.nodes.board.classList.toggle('is-collapsed', isHidden);\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            if (this.nodes.selectorGroup) {\n                this.nodes.selectorGroup.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                    e.stopPropagation();\n                    const targetBtn = e.target.closest('.toggle-item');\n                    if (targetBtn) {\n                        this.currentStrategy = targetBtn.dataset.strategy;\n                        localStorage.setItem(APP_CONFIG.memoryKey, this.currentStrategy);\n                        this.syncToggleVisuals();\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            if (this.nodes.track) {\n                this.nodes.track.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                    const block = e.target.closest('.choice-block');\n                    if (block) {\n                        const textPayload = decodeURIComponent(block.dataset.val);\n                        this.dispatchAction(textPayload);\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        syncToggleVisuals() {\n            this.nodes.toggles.forEach(btn => {\n                const isSelected = btn.dataset.strategy === this.currentStrategy;\n                btn.classList.toggle('is-selected', isSelected);\n            });\n        }\n\n        dispatchAction(text) {\n            try {\n                const pDoc = window.parent.document;\n                const inputBox = pDoc.querySelector('#send_textarea');\n                const apiTrigger = window.parent.triggerSlash;\n\n                const executors = {\n                    direct: () => {\n                        if (apiTrigger) {\n                            apiTrigger('/setinput ' + text);\n                        } else if (inputBox) {\n                            inputBox.value = text;\n                            inputBox.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true }));\n                        }\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            const sendBtn = pDoc.querySelector('#send_but');\n                            if (sendBtn) sendBtn.click();\n                        }, 300);\n                    },\n                    concat: () => {\n                        if (inputBox) {\n                            const currentVal = inputBox.value.trim();\n                            inputBox.value = currentVal ? `${currentVal} ${text}` : text;\n                            inputBox.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true }));\n                        } else if (apiTrigger) {\n                            apiTrigger('/setinput ' + text);\n                        }\n                    }\n                };\n\n                if (executors[this.currentStrategy]) {\n                    executors[this.currentStrategy]();\n                }\n\n            } catch (err) {\n                console.warn('跨域或DOM操作被拒绝', err);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    try {\n        new StoryController();\n    } catch (e) {\n        console.error(\"面板初始化失败:\", e);\n    }\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```",
        "placement": [
